shabbir ki beti bewa dulhan , aur ibne hasan bekas dulha<br />
<br />
ye be qabari mujh se qasim, chilte hai mere pohnche qasim<br />
khulwaado ke uljhi jaati hai , kangne me rasan bekas dulha<br />
<br />
Hai qouf mujhe naaraz na ho, marzi hai tumhaari kya bolo<br />
mai haath me ab kangna rakhu , ya rakhu rasan bekas dulha<br />
<br />
hum naam hu mai bhi daadi ki, hai tum ko qasam is shaadi ki<br />
banwaado mujhe bhi rone ko, ek baitul hazan bekas dulha<br />
<br />
tha mujh ko tumhaare ghar chalna, laazim tha tumhei'n mil kar chalna<br />
raste hi me mujh ko chord gaye , hai door watan bekas dulha<br />
